\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Comparison on RepCount-A (test). MAE$\downarrow $, OBO$\uparrow $. Our scorer: 151 positive-count videos, rounded counts, MAE denominator $c_i+0.1$. Unmarked external rows are literature-reported, including third-party reproductions; their protocols and training data differ. Input: V = RGB video, P = pose, F = optical flow, L = large language model with web-scale video--text pretraining. $\ddagger $: official released checkpoint evaluated by us with our protocol. $\S  $: trained on an 8-class, 487-video subset. $\P  $: skeleton-only and self-supervised. TempoRAC\xspace  : mean$\pm $std over three seeds of one jointly trained model per seed (two-view average). Lowest listed RGB-based MAE and highest listed RGB-based OBO in bold. The two ESCounts rows represent one framework.}}{6}{table.caption.17}\protected@file@percent }
